{"3776070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Noctheria", "steam_appid": 3776070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a <strong>Survival Horror Adventure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Novice Priestess of the <strong>Church of Dendrael</strong>, sent to a ceremony in <strong>Albadusk</strong>, the land where it is said <strong>Dendrael</strong> impaled himself on a tree to save humanity. What could possibly go wrong?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/051f37c0f7b9a86ed11f0de6e7a76fba.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/051f37c0f7b9a86ed11f0de6e7a76fba.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/051f37c0f7b9a86ed11f0de6e7a76fba.mp4?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An uncommon mix of genres</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The free exploration and dungeon structure of classic action-adventure, full of the dread of horror. Roam the world at your own pace, solve dungeons by wit alone, and face whatever stalks them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ebff0f58516f0f499c5969b1581729f4.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ebff0f58516f0f499c5969b1581729f4.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ebff0f58516f0f499c5969b1581729f4.mp4?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into varied dungeons and landscapes in your search for the truth. Every dungeon is a puzzle: the only way forward is through focus and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/291ad326c7ce19e9adb57c010c9e7074.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/291ad326c7ce19e9adb57c010c9e7074.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/291ad326c7ce19e9adb57c010c9e7074.mp4?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools you earn inside the dungeons are more than keys to move forward. Take them back out into the world and you'll reach secrets that were closed to you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.mp4?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and focused on quality over quantity: </strong>roam Albadusk and its <strong>Sacred Temples</strong>, each with its own character, dangers, and secrets, a <strong>small but dense</strong> world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gimmick and combat bosses: </strong>not every boss is fought the same way. Each encounter forces you to figure out how to approach it before you can win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle dungeons: </strong>the only way forward is through wit, attention to detail, and reasoning. If you like puzzles in your horror games, this is for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover deep lore: </strong>learn the legend of <strong>Dendrael</strong> and the Eternal gods, and the mystery of the Shaman, the one many name as the source of the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere: </strong>inspired by the N64 era, with the soul of a survival horror. Dungeon design, free exploration, and a constant sense of danger and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark religious aesthetic.</strong>  </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a <strong>Survival Horror Adventure</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Novice Priestess of the <strong>Church of Dendrael</strong>, sent to a ceremony in <strong>Albadusk</strong>, the land where it is said <strong>Dendrael</strong> impaled himself on a tree to save humanity. What could possibly go wrong?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/051f37c0f7b9a86ed11f0de6e7a76fba.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/051f37c0f7b9a86ed11f0de6e7a76fba.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9