></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Dungeons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tools you earn inside the dungeons are more than keys to move forward. Take them back out into the world and you'll reach secrets that were closed to you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.poster.avif?t=1785036695\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.webm?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/extras/ff29667c4f5577e970b68ff3ab9c6083.mp4?t=1785036695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and focused on quality over quantity: </strong>roam Albadusk and its <strong>Sacred Temples</strong>, each with its own character, dangers, and secrets, a <strong>small but dense</strong> world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gimmick and combat bosses: </strong>not every boss is fought the same way. Each encounter forces you to figure out how to approach it before you can win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle dungeons: </strong>the only way forward is through wit, attention to detail, and reasoning. If you like puzzles in your horror games, this is for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover deep lore: </strong>learn the legend of <strong>Dendrael</strong> and the Eternal gods, and the mystery of the Shaman, the one many name as the source of the evil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere: </strong>inspired by the N64 era, with the soul of a survival horror. Dungeon design, free exploration, and a constant sense of danger and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark religious aesthetic.</strong>  </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A retro horror action-adventure. Explore cursed dungeons, solve their puzzles, and find the tools that open each new path. All while uncovering the truth of ancient gods.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/e090e85aa5c663c93774476e974387e89c3d7757/header.jpg?t=1785036695", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/4a821b7905af230eb144f0b5950875d8feba3f4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785036695", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776070/4a821b7905af230eb144f0b5950875d8feba3f4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785036695", "website": "https://zombiebyte.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i7 8th generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM Or Greater with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel core i7 8th generation<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM Or Greater with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["zombiebytegames"], "publishers": ["zombiebytegame